{"overview":"این درام حماسی هزاران سال پیش از «هابیت» و «ارباب حلقه‌ها» تالکین روی می‌دهد و بینندگان را به دورانی می‌برد که قدرت‌های بزرگ شکل گرفتند، حکومت‌هایی ظهور و سقوط کردند، قهرمانان غیرمنتظره آزموده شدند، امید در آستانه فروپاشی بود و بزرگ‌ترین شخصیت شروری که بر قلم تالکین جاری شده دنیا را تهدید به فروغلتیدن در ظلمت می‌کرد.","tagline":"سفری به سرزمین میانی.","overview_en":"Beginning in a time of relative peace, we follow an ensemble cast of characters as they confront the re-emergence of evil to Middle-earth. From the darkest depths of the Misty Mountains, to the majestic forests of Lindon, to the breathtaking island kingdom of Númenor, to the furthest reaches of the map, these kingdoms and characters will carve out legacies that live on long after they are gone.","tagline_en":"Evil has had many names.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":36,"y":2022,"poster":"/friNlTnLbsg38DRnUYLfKLdLBJE.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل ۱","ep":8,"y":2022,"poster":"/zZVQbQV7djOnO8ugeJ8iQKm3I4U.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":2024,"poster":"/eTQLv1sjLhDBPwI2u0qaqV51HWU.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/xw9VIpdX0n0BNQRMLWj8Y0T4yew.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":["Patrick McKay","John D. Payne"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"مورفید کلارک","role":"Galadriel","photo":"/kG1Xg85F9yAggCMquo4XouAOjdo.jpg","en":"Morfydd Clark"},{"name":"رابرت آرمایو","role":"Elrond","photo":"/1wqSZVvB018H2mZbemMSn6gH4zq.jpg","en":"Robert Aramayo"},{"name":"Owain Arthur","role":"Durin IV","photo":"/ljqVjVzp9pgcfTTU3oJbKtnd6im.jpg"},{"name":"Sophia Nomvete","role":"Disa","photo":"/fRglwdtHHjLGAMIoCkqXwQ9bIfd.jpg"},{"name":"Markella Kavenagh","role":"Elanor 'Nori' Brandyfoot","photo":"/gHBoS2Ql0ywj6kfkxixqPPryqTQ.jpg"},{"name":"Ismael Cruz Cordova","role":"Arondir","photo":"/oXcrsQGndk60iFkNB8qFnMHlNzL.jpg"}],"trailer":"x8UAUAuKNcU","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/84773-the-lord-of-the-rings-the-rings-o